    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Odchoz\u00ed kan\u00e1ly", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Ud\u00e1losti z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed uvnit\u0159 aplikace;pokud chcete, po\u0161lete stejn\u00e9 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed do oznamovac\u00edho centra va\u0161eho telefonu nebo do telegramu.Nic z toho nen\u00ed vy\u017eadov\u00e1no.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Zadejte n\u00e1zev t\u00e9matu \u2013 nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd \u00fa\u010det", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "T\u00e9ma", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed k tomuto t\u00e9matu jsou publikov\u00e1na na ntfy.sh;pokud zn\u00e1te n\u00e1zev t\u00e9matu, obdr\u017e\u00edte je pouze vy.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Email", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed se zas\u00edlaj\u00ed na e-mailovou adresu va\u0161eho \u00fa\u010dtu", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Odesl\u00e1no na va\u0161i vlastn\u00ed adresu p\u0159i p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed;v aplikaci nejsou ulo\u017eena \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 tajemstv\u00ed.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "P\u0159\u00edjemce", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Ozn\u00e1men\u00ed nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d za\u0159\u00edzen\u00edmi", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed \u010dlena rodiny doraz\u00ed do oznamovac\u00edho centra, i kdy\u017e je aplikace zav\u0159en\u00e1", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "P\u0159ejde do oznamovac\u00edch center ostatn\u00edch \u010dlen\u016f a va\u0161ich ostatn\u00edch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed;p\u0159\u00edjemce mus\u00ed m\u00edt tento kan\u00e1l na sv\u00e9m za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed povolen.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST na v\u00e1\u0161 vlastn\u00ed server \u2013 pokro\u010dil\u00e9", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "P\u0159ij\u00edm\u00e1 se pouze HTTPS;ka\u017ed\u00e1 ud\u00e1lost je odesl\u00e1na jako {zdroj, id, n\u00e1zev, podrobnosti, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Bot token", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "ID chatu", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Token robota z\u016fstane pouze na tomto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Token se nikdy nenahraje do cloudu;zadejte jej znovu na jin\u00fdch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00edch.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
