    "\u00d6deme ge\u00e7mi\u015fi (Sipari\u015flerim)": "Historie plateb (Moje objedn\u00e1vky)", // EN: Payment history (My Orders)
    "Faturaland\u0131rmay\u0131 y\u00f6net": "Spravovat fakturaci", // EN: Manage billing
    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Probl\u00e9m s objedn\u00e1vkou?Odeslat zp\u011btnou vazbu", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "P\u0159ipraven\u00e9 polo\u017eky nyn\u00ed funguj\u00ed;polo\u017eky, kter\u00e9 nejsou p\u0159ipraveny, jsou ozna\u010deny jako \u201eJi\u017e brzy\u201c.", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Podpora Apple Watch ji\u017e brzy", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS zat\u00edm neobsahuje aplikaci pro Apple Watch.Po uvoln\u011bn\u00ed budete moci spou\u0161t\u011bt sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159e a zobrazovat kritick\u00e1 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed ze sv\u00e9ho z\u00e1p\u011bst\u00ed.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Co m\u016f\u017eete d\u011blat dnes", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Nechte si zapnut\u00e1 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed na kritick\u00e9 ud\u00e1losti;upozorn\u011bn\u00ed na telefonu uvid\u00edte okam\u017eit\u011b.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Zda se tato ozn\u00e1men\u00ed zobraz\u00ed na va\u0161ich hodink\u00e1ch, z\u00e1vis\u00ed na nastaven\u00ed hodinek va\u0161eho iPhone;NEXUS do hodinek nic konkr\u00e9tn\u00edho nepos\u00edl\u00e1.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Otev\u0159ete Nastaven\u00ed ozn\u00e1men\u00ed", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kop\u00edrovat kl\u00ed\u010d", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Otev\u0159ete v aplikaci pro ov\u011b\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Pokud ztrat\u00edte p\u0159\u00edstup ke sv\u00e9 ov\u011b\u0159ovac\u00ed aplikaci, nebudete se moci p\u0159ihl\u00e1sit, proto\u017ee p\u0159i p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed je vy\u017eadov\u00e1n k\u00f3d.Ulo\u017ete tento kl\u00ed\u010d na bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 m\u00edsto.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Kl\u00ed\u010d zkop\u00edrov\u00e1n \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Nelze kop\u00edrovat;zadejte kl\u00ed\u010d ru\u010dn\u011b.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
    "6 haneli kod": "6m\u00edstn\u00fd k\u00f3d", // EN: 6-digit code
    "Do\u011frula": "Ov\u011b\u0159te", // EN: Verify
    "Yak\u0131nda": "Ji\u017e brzy", // EN: Coming soon
    "Hesab\u0131m": "M\u016fj \u00fa\u010det", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Smazat m\u016fj \u00fa\u010det", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "V\u00e1\u0161 \u00fa\u010det, profil a synchronizovan\u00e1 data budou trvale smaz\u00e1na.Pokud m\u00e1te aktivn\u00ed p\u0159edplatn\u00e9 NEXUS+, nejprve ho zru\u0161te v \u010d\u00e1sti Fakturace.Toto nelze vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "jsi si jist\u00fd?Dal\u0161\u00edm klepnut\u00edm sma\u017eete", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Maz\u00e1n\u00ed\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "\u00da\u010det smaz\u00e1n.Nezapome\u0148te zru\u0161it p\u0159edplatn\u00e9 ze sv\u00e9ho \u00fa\u010dtu Whop.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "V\u00e1\u0161 \u00fa\u010det a data byly smaz\u00e1ny.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "K odstran\u011bn\u00ed dat NEXUS na tomto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed sta\u010d\u00ed Nastaven\u00ed \u2192 Odhl\u00e1sit se;neexistuje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd cloudov\u00fd \u00fa\u010det.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Smaz\u00e1n\u00ed \u00fa\u010dtu na stran\u011b serveru je\u0161t\u011b nen\u00ed nasazeno.Zat\u00edm se m\u016f\u017eete odhl\u00e1sit.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "!Zapnul jsem re\u017eim Neru\u0161it;\u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed v\u00e1s nebudou obt\u011b\u017eovat.[AKCE: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\" sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159 lze prozat\u00edm spustit jedn\u00edm klepnut\u00edm z karty Tap to Run na domovsk\u00e9 obrazovce. Jakmile bude NEXUS v App Store, budete jej moci p\u0159idat do Siri p\u0159\u00edmo z t\u00e9to obrazovky.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "\u201c a v\u0161echna jeho nastaven\u00ed budou trvale smaz\u00e1na.jsi si jist\u00fd?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
