    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "Posledn\u00ed zn\u00e1m\u00fd stav va\u0161ich za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.Hodnota, kter\u00e1 nebyla p\u0159e\u010dtena, zobrazuje \"Stav nep\u0159e\u010dten\".", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "ZA\u0158\u00cdZEN\u00cd, KTER\u00c1 SE ZOBRAZUJ\u00cd NA", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
    "A\u00e7\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fcnen cihaz yok.": "Zd\u00e1 se, \u017ee \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nen\u00ed zapnut\u00e9.", // EN: No device appears to be on.
    "G\u00dcVENL\u0130K C\u0130HAZLARI": "ZABEZPE\u010cOVAC\u00cd ZA\u0158\u00cdZEN\u00cd", // EN: SECURITY DEVICES
    "Kilit, kap\u0131 sens\u00f6r\u00fc veya kamera eklenmemi\u015f.": "Nen\u00ed p\u0159id\u00e1n \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd z\u00e1mek, dve\u0159n\u00ed senzor ani kamera.", // EN: No lock, door sensor or camera added.
    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "Stav nep\u0159e\u010dten", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Toto je ji\u017e e-mailov\u00e1 adresa, kterou pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te.Zadejte jin\u00fd.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Tato e-mailov\u00e1 adresa je registrov\u00e1na k jin\u00e9mu \u00fa\u010dtu.Zkuste jin\u00fd.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "P\u0159\u00edli\u0161 mnoho pokus\u016f.Zkuste to znovu za n\u011bkolik minut.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Offline", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "C\u00edl nebyl p\u0159e\u010dten", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e1 nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 data", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Va\u0161e za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed zat\u00edm nehl\u00e1sila teplotu, vlhkost ani kvalitu vzduchu.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je senzor zapnut\u00fd a p\u0159ipojen\u00fd k s\u00edti.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Nejnov\u011bj\u0161\u00ed \u010dten\u00ed", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Nevytv\u00e1\u0159\u00edme partituru;jsou zobrazeny pouze skute\u010dn\u00e9 hodnoty na\u010dten\u00e9 z va\u0161ich za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Po dokon\u010den\u00ed se to pou\u017eije na n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 vhodn\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed pro p\u0159\u00edpravu sp\u00e1nku", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Jakmile p\u0159id\u00e1te sv\u011btlo, z\u00e1v\u011bs, z\u00e1mek nebo klimatiza\u010dn\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, p\u0159\u00edprava je uvedena zde.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Posledn\u00ed zn\u00e1m\u00fd stav a hodnoty va\u0161ich klimatiza\u010dn\u00edch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "Soukrom\u00ed fotoapar\u00e1tu", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Spravujte re\u017eim soukrom\u00ed ka\u017ed\u00e9 kamery samostatn\u011b.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
    "Kamera cihaz\u0131 yok": "\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 kamerov\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: No camera device
    "Kamera ekledi\u011finde gizlilik modu her kamera i\u00e7in burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Jakmile p\u0159id\u00e1te kameru, zobraz\u00ed se zde jej\u00ed re\u017eim soukrom\u00ed.", // EN: Once you add a camera, its privacy mode appears here.
    "Bu senaryoyu uygulayacak uygun cihaz yok": "\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 vhodn\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed pro spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed tohoto sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159e", // EN: No suitable device to run this scenario
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, klima veya kilit gibi uyumlu bir cihaz ekledi\u011finde burada listelenir.": "Jakmile p\u0159id\u00e1te kompatibiln\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, jako je sv\u011btlo, z\u00e1v\u011bs, klimatizace nebo z\u00e1mek, bude zde uvedeno.", // EN: Once you add a compatible device such as a light, curtain, air conditioner or lock, it is listed here.
