    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 kutu": "Chytr\u00fd box", // EN: Smart box
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, anahtar ve enerji \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "Chytr\u00e9 z\u00e1str\u010dky, vyp\u00edna\u010de a energetick\u00e9 produkty", // EN: Smart plugs, switches and energy products
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Rychl\u00e9 \u00faspory tok\u016f pro chytr\u00e9 z\u00e1suvky a energeticky zam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Spojte chytr\u00e9 z\u00e1str\u010dky a energeticky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed na jednom m\u00edst\u011b.Vytv\u00e1\u0159ejte profily pro okam\u017eit\u00e9 ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed a pl\u00e1novan\u00e9 ekologick\u00e9 akce.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Vytvo\u0159te energeticky \u00fasporn\u00fd panel, kter\u00fd spravuje chytr\u00e9 z\u00e1suvky a energeticky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.P\u0159idejte rychl\u00e9 vypnut\u00ed, ekologick\u00e9 profily, pl\u00e1novan\u00e9 ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed a souhrny vyu\u017eit\u00ed.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
