    "Bilgi": "Info", // EN: Info
    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Po zad\u00e1n\u00ed sv\u00fdch \u00fadaj\u016f m\u016f\u017eete snadno obnovit heslo podle pokyn\u016f, kter\u00e9 v\u00e1m za\u0161leme.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Pou\u017eijte desktopovou aplikaci NEXUS v po\u010d\u00edta\u010di;funguje tam stejn\u00fd asistent a ovl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Chatujte tak\u00e9 ze sv\u00e9ho po\u010d\u00edta\u010de;va\u0161e konverzace z\u016fstanou synchronizovan\u00e9 nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d va\u0161imi za\u0159\u00edzen\u00edmi.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "P\u0159ipojte se k domovu", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e se za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed zapne nebo vypne", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Klepnut\u00edm na za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed otev\u0159ete ovl\u00e1dac\u00ed obrazovku panelu;zobrazuje pouze funkce, kter\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed podporuje.U za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed Shelly, WLED a ESPHome jde zapnut\u00ed/vypnut\u00ed a jas p\u0159\u00edmo na za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Tento k\u00f3d se pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 na domovsk\u00e9 obrazovce.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "Sta\u010d\u00ed jedno klepnut\u00ed", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Jakmile vytvo\u0159\u00edte pl\u00e1n, objev\u00ed se zde \u010dasy a akce se skute\u010dn\u00fdmi daty.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Zobraz\u00ed se zde, jakmile vytvo\u0159\u00edte pl\u00e1n.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
    "Bir sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "N\u011bco je \u0161patn\u011b?Odeslat zp\u011btnou vazbu", // EN: Something wrong? Send feedback
