    "Br\u00fcksel": "Brusel", // EN: Brussels
    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento 8m\u00edstn\u00fd k\u00f3d je pro p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed Apple HomeKit a funguje pouze s aplikac\u00ed Apple Home.Pokud za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed podporuje m\u00edstn\u00ed API, jako je Shelly, WLED nebo Tasmota, m\u016f\u017eete jej p\u0159idat z m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Toto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento QR k\u00f3d pat\u0159\u00ed s\u00edti Wi-Fi, nikoli za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.Po p\u0159ipojen\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed ke stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti jej m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159idat z m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Na t\u00e9to adrese nebylo nalezeno \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 zn\u00e1m\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed NEXUS.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed zapnut\u00e9 a ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Vytvo\u0159te tuto chytrou aplikaci:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "P\u0159\u00edprava navrhovan\u00fdch funkc\u00ed pro tento tok.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Ulo\u017eeno tento m\u011bs\u00edc", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "V t\u00e9to s\u00edti nebylo nalezeno \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 podporovan\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "V t\u00e9to s\u00edti nebylo nalezeno \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 podporovan\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed zapnut\u00e9 a p\u0159ipojen\u00e9 ke stejn\u00e9 Wi-Fi;jinak pou\u017eijte n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00fd katalog nebo QR / nastavovac\u00ed k\u00f3d.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "M\u00edstn\u00ed ochrana tohoto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Toto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nesd\u00edl\u00ed informace o verzi", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Toto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nebo p\u0159ipojen\u00ed nepodporuje sv\u00edtilnu.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Toto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nepodporuje automatick\u00e9 ur\u010dov\u00e1n\u00ed polohy.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Tento zvac\u00ed k\u00f3d nebyl nalezen.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Tato obrazovka seskupuje osv\u011btlovac\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e1 jste p\u0159idali, podle m\u00edstnosti;kdy\u017e sc\u00e9nu ulo\u017e\u00edte, jas a t\u00f3n se nastav\u00ed spole\u010dn\u011b.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Zde jsou uvedena za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e1 p\u0159id\u00e1te do t\u00e9to dom\u00e1cnosti.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e1 p\u0159id\u00e1te do t\u00e9to dom\u00e1cnosti, jsou zde uvedena a propojena s va\u0161imi obl\u00edben\u00fdmi kartami.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Opravdu chcete trvale smazat tuto dom\u00e1cnost a v\u0161echna jej\u00ed nastaven\u00ed?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento k\u00f3d nen\u00ed podporovan\u00fd k\u00f3d za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.Pokud zn\u00e1te IP adresu za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, m\u016f\u017eete ji p\u0159idat z m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Tyto zna\u010dky jsou ovl\u00e1d\u00e1ny prost\u0159ednictv\u00edm va\u0161\u00ed m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Tato mini aplikace je poskytov\u00e1na ofici\u00e1ln\u00edm poskytovatelem.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Toto prost\u0159ed\u00ed nepodporuje p\u0159\u00edstup k fotoapar\u00e1tu.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "S\u00ed\u0165ov\u00e9 skenov\u00e1n\u00ed zde nen\u00ed k dispozici.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 \u0161ifrov\u00e1n\u00ed v tomto prost\u0159ed\u00ed", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "P\u0159i spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed tohoto sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159e se automaticky uprav\u00ed souvisej\u00edc\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Tento sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159 nem\u00e1 vliv na \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed \u2013 nejprve p\u0159idejte vhodn\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Chcete-li pou\u017e\u00edt tento sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159, mus\u00edte p\u0159idat kompatibiln\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Toto je v\u00e1\u0161 jedin\u00fd domov.Pokud jej sma\u017eete, znovu se vytvo\u0159\u00ed pr\u00e1zdn\u00fd \u201eM\u016fj domov\u201c.Pokra\u010dovat?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
