    "Cihaz ekledik\u00e7e tasarrufun burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Zde se zobraz\u00ed va\u0161e \u00faspory, kdy\u017e p\u0159id\u00e1te za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Your savings appear here as you add devices.
