    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Pro\u010d se moje za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed zobrazuje jako offline?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Zadejte IP adresu za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a NEXUS zjist\u00ed, kter\u00fd protokol mluv\u00ed.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Zkontrolujte p\u0159ipojen\u00ed Wi-Fi za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a router.Pokud probl\u00e9m p\u0159etrv\u00e1v\u00e1, odeberte za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a znovu jej p\u0159idejte.Postup: Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed > vyberte za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed > Odebrat.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Zkontrolujte p\u0159ipojen\u00ed Wi-Fi za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a router.Pokud probl\u00e9m p\u0159etrv\u00e1v\u00e1, odeberte za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed z aplikace NEXUS a znovu jej p\u0159idejte.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Pokud se va\u0161e za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nezobraz\u00ed, pou\u017eijte skenov\u00e1n\u00ed QR k\u00f3d\u016f nebo k\u00f3d nastaven\u00ed.M\u016f\u017eete otev\u0159\u00edt str\u00e1nku n\u00e1pov\u011bdy pro podporu a pokyny.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Slu\u017eba ur\u010dov\u00e1n\u00ed polohy (GPS) va\u0161eho za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed je vypnut\u00e1.Zapn\u011bte jej a zkuste to znovu.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Va\u0161e za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nepodporuje slu\u017eby ur\u010dov\u00e1n\u00ed polohy.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nen\u00ed na seznamu?Odeslat zp\u011btnou vazbu", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
