    "Cihaz\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n \u00fczerindeki 8 haneli kodu girin.": "Zadejte 8m\u00edstn\u00fd k\u00f3d na sv\u00e9m za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Enter the 8-digit code on your device.
