    "Hen\u00fcz okunmad\u0131": "Je\u0161t\u011b ne\u010dteno", // EN: Not read yet
    "senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131": "b\u011b\u017eela sc\u00e9na", // EN: ran a scene
    "uyar\u0131 payla\u015ft\u0131": "sd\u00edlel upozorn\u011bn\u00ed", // EN: shared an alert
    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Tento t\u00fdden \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 v\u00fdrazn\u00e1 aktivita.Sc\u00e9na b\u011b\u017e\u00ed a shroma\u017e\u010fuj\u00ed se zde v\u00fdstrahy.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "N\u00e1kupn\u00ed seznam, dom\u00e1c\u00ed pr\u00e1ce nebo rychl\u00e9 pozn\u00e1mky \u2013 p\u0159idejte prvn\u00ed polo\u017eku, kterou chcete sd\u00edlet s rodinou.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "P\u0159edstavenstvo pat\u0159\u00ed \u010dlen\u016fm va\u0161eho domova.Vytvo\u0159te si domov ze Spr\u00e1vy dom\u00e1cnosti nebo se p\u0159ipojte pomoc\u00ed pozv\u00e1nky.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "Tato polo\u017eka je odstran\u011bna z n\u00e1st\u011bnky pro v\u0161echny \u010dleny.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
    "Pano \u015fu an kapal\u0131.": "Deska je moment\u00e1ln\u011b nedostupn\u00e1.", // EN: The board is unavailable right now.
    "Ev Panosu i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Chcete-li pou\u017e\u00edvat Home Board, p\u0159ihlaste se.", // EN: Sign in to use the Home Board.
    "Ev Panosu bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Home Board nen\u00ed v tomto sestaven\u00ed k dispozici.", // EN: Home Board is unavailable in this build.
    "Pano y\u00fckleniyor\u2026": "Na\u010d\u00edt\u00e1n\u00ed desky\u2026", // EN: Loading board…
