    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Stiskn\u011bte kulat\u00e9 tla\u010d\u00edtko v horn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1sti mostu a do 30 sekund klepn\u011bte na \u201eP\u0159ipojit most\u201c.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "K mostu se nepoda\u0159ilo p\u0159ipojit.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee jste ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti, a zkuste to znovu.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
