    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "Va\u0161e body NEXUS AI se obnovuj\u00ed ka\u017ed\u00fd den;ka\u017ed\u00e1 funkce je nyn\u00ed zdarma.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
