    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "M\u016f\u017eete se p\u0159ipojit zad\u00e1n\u00edm tohoto k\u00f3du do \u201eJoin a Home\u201c v NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Spus\u0165te sv\u00e9 sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159e NEXUS hlasem pomoc\u00ed Siri b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika sekund.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS je m\u00edstn\u00ed: data va\u0161eho za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed z\u016fst\u00e1vaj\u00ed v tomto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, p\u0159\u00edkazy za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed jdou p\u0159\u00edmo p\u0159es va\u0161i m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00ed\u0165 a nic nen\u00ed sd\u00edleno s t\u0159et\u00edmi stranami.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
