    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "P\u0159ipojte NEXUS k jin\u00fdm platform\u00e1m a ovl\u00e1dejte sv\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed odkudkoli.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Tato servisn\u00ed p\u0159ipojen\u00ed zat\u00edm nejsou k dispozici.Pro za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed t\u0159et\u00edch stran m\u016f\u017eete pou\u017e\u00edt Home Assistant od Integrations.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
