    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ zat\u00edm nen\u00ed v prodeji.P\u0159id\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159\u016f a NEXUS AI je nyn\u00ed zcela zdarma;zde v\u00e1m d\u00e1me v\u011bd\u011bt, a\u017e se p\u0159edplatn\u00e9 otev\u0159ou.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
