    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "NEXUS automaticky detekuje k\u00f3d uvnit\u0159 r\u00e1me\u010dku a zah\u00e1j\u00ed p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
