    "Uyand\u0131rma cihaz\u0131 olarak ekle": "P\u0159idat jako za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed pro probuzen\u00ed", // EN: Add as a wake-up device
    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Na t\u00e9to adrese je za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e9 v\u0161ak neum\u00ed protokol NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Toto za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed je ji\u017e p\u0159id\u00e1no.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Sp\u00e1rujte a p\u0159idejte", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "P\u00e1rovac\u00ed k\u00f3d nen\u00ed platn\u00fd.Zadejte 11m\u00edstn\u00fd k\u00f3d nebo obsah QR za\u010d\u00ednaj\u00edc\u00ed na MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Zadejte tento k\u00f3d do desktopov\u00e9 aplikace NEXUS.Pokud je za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed na Wi-Fi, m\u016f\u017eete jej tak\u00e9 p\u0159idat z m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edt\u011b podle jeho IP adresy.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed se hled\u00e1 ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti a sp\u00e1ruje se.To m\u016f\u017ee trvat a\u017e minutu;za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed mus\u00ed b\u00fdt zapnut\u00e9 a v re\u017eimu p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nebylo nalezeno nebo se nepoda\u0159ilo sp\u00e1rovat.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti, je zapnut\u00fd a v re\u017eimu p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nebylo nalezeno.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti, je zapnut\u00fd a v re\u017eimu p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed.Br\u00e1na firewall va\u0161eho po\u010d\u00edta\u010de m\u016f\u017ee blokovat odpov\u011bdi ze za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed v m\u00edstn\u00ed s\u00edti.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed se nepoda\u0159ilo sp\u00e1rovat.Zkontrolujte p\u00e1rovac\u00ed k\u00f3d a zkontrolujte, zda je za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed v re\u017eimu p\u00e1rov\u00e1n\u00ed.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed sp\u00e1rovan\u00e9, ale nem\u00e1 \u017e\u00e1dnou funkci, kterou NEXUS dok\u00e1\u017ee ovl\u00e1dat.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed nereagovalo.Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee je zapnuto a ve stejn\u00e9 s\u00edti.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
