    "QR okunamazsa, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki manuel ekleme se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle kodu elle girin.": "Pokud QR nelze p\u0159e\u010d\u00edst, zadejte k\u00f3d ru\u010dn\u011b pomoc\u00ed mo\u017enosti ru\u010dn\u00ed n\u00ed\u017ee.", // EN: If the QR can't be read, enter the code manually with the manual option below.
    "QR tarama, kurulum kodu ve manuel katalog ile cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ger\u00e7ek ak\u0131\u015f \u00fczerinden ekleyebilirsin.": "Sv\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed m\u016f\u017eete p\u0159idat automatick\u00fdm skenov\u00e1n\u00edm, QR k\u00f3dem, nastavovac\u00edm k\u00f3dem nebo manu\u00e1lem.", // EN: You can add your devices by automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
