    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Samoz\u0159ejm\u011b!Mohu pro v\u00e1s sestavit skv\u011bl\u00fd chytr\u00fd sc\u00e9n\u00e1\u0159.M\u016f\u017eete mi d\u00e1t p\u00e1r podrobnost\u00ed?Nap\u0159\u00edklad: \u201eZapni k\u00e1vovar, kdy\u017e se probud\u00edm\u201c nebo \u201e\u00dapln\u011b ztlum\u00edm sv\u011btla, kdy\u017e se d\u00edv\u00e1m na film\u201c.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
