    "Ev bo\u015fken tasarruf, taklit hareket ve uyar\u0131 tek panelde.": "\u00daspory, simulovan\u00e1 p\u0159\u00edtomnost a upozorn\u011bn\u00ed na jednom panelu, kdy\u017e je domov pr\u00e1zdn\u00fd.", // EN: Savings, simulated presence and alerts in one panel while the home is empty.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Pl\u00e1ny dn\u016f a m\u00edstnost\u00ed pro robotick\u00e9 vysava\u010de a \u010distic\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
