    "Yatak odas\u0131": "Lo\u017enice", // EN: Bedroom
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Shrom\u00e1\u017ed\u011bte v\u0161echny dom\u00e1c\u00ed kontroly, kter\u00e9 pot\u0159ebujete p\u0159ed span\u00edm, v jednom centru.Ztlumen\u00ed sv\u011btel, neru\u0161it, kontrola z\u00e1mku a nastaven\u00ed no\u010dn\u00ed klimatizace na jedn\u00e9 obrazovce.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Vytvo\u0159te si centrum pro p\u0159\u00edpravu p\u0159ed span\u00edm, kter\u00e9 \u0159\u00edd\u00ed sv\u011btla, tich\u00fd re\u017eim, z\u00e1mky a klima p\u0159ed span\u00edm.P\u0159idejte z\u00e1v\u011bre\u010dn\u00e9 shrnut\u00ed kontroly a no\u010dn\u00ed re\u017eim jedn\u00edm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
