    "Cihaz Se\u00e7": "Vyberte Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: Choose Devices
    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Otev\u0159ete tuto obrazovku v aplikaci NEXUS na va\u0161em iPhone;va\u0161e sc\u00e9ny jsou uvedeny n\u00ed\u017ee a pro ka\u017edou z nich m\u016f\u017eete nastavit zkratku Siri.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Zkop\u00edrujte odkaz na sc\u00e9nu", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Tento odkaz otev\u0159e NEXUS a okam\u017eit\u011b spust\u00ed sc\u00e9nu.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. Vytvo\u0159te nov\u00e9ho z\u00e1stupce v Z\u00e1stupci", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Vyberte \u201eP\u0159idat akci\u201c \u203a \u201eOtev\u0159\u00edt adresy URL\u201c a vlo\u017ete odkaz, kter\u00fd jste zkop\u00edrovali.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
    "Kestirmeler uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7": "Otev\u0159ete aplikaci Zkratky", // EN: Open the Shortcuts app
    "Cihazlar\u0131na uyan haz\u0131r otomasyonlardan birini tek dokunu\u015fla ekle.": "P\u0159idejte hotovou automatizaci, kter\u00e1 se hod\u00ed pro va\u0161e za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed jedin\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Add a ready-made automation that fits your devices with one tap.
    "Belirli bir saatte; her g\u00fcn, hafta i\u00e7i ya da hafta sonu": "Ve stanoven\u00fd \u010das;ka\u017ed\u00fd den, ve v\u0161edn\u00ed dny nebo o v\u00edkendu", // EN: At a set time; every day, on weekdays or at weekends
