    "Ev konumuna g\u00f6re g\u00fcne\u015f do\u011farken ya da batarken": "P\u0159i v\u00fdchodu nebo z\u00e1padu slunce pro m\u00edsto va\u0161eho domova", // EN: At sunrise or sunset for your home location
    "Cihaz ve Sens\u00f6r": "Za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a senzory", // EN: Devices & Sensors
    "Hareket Alg\u0131land\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e je detekov\u00e1n pohyb", // EN: When Motion Is Detected
    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc bir hareket alg\u0131lad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e pohybov\u00fd senzor zaznamen\u00e1 pohyb", // EN: When a motion sensor detects movement
    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e se otev\u0159ou dve\u0159e nebo okno", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e se otev\u0159e dve\u0159n\u00ed/okenn\u00ed senzor", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kdy\u017e senzor kou\u0159e, z\u00e1plavy nebo plynu spust\u00ed alarm", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Po p\u0159id\u00e1n\u00ed vhodn\u00e9ho za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed se zde objev\u00ed spou\u0161t\u011b\u010de za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed a senzor\u016f.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
