    "T\u00fcm \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7": "Zapn\u011bte v\u0161echna sv\u011btla", // EN: Turn on all lights
    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Ve\u010de\u0159e", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Otev\u0159ete z\u00e1v\u011bsy", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Zamkn\u011bte dve\u0159e", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Rozsv\u00edt\u00ed ka\u017ed\u00e9 sv\u011btlo na pln\u00fd jas.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Zhasne ka\u017ed\u00e9 sv\u011btlo.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Rozsv\u00edt\u00ed sv\u011btla na pln\u00fd jas v t\u00f3nu denn\u00edho sv\u011btla.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Nastav\u00ed sv\u011btla na 85 % v neutr\u00e1ln\u00edm t\u00f3nu a vypne televizor.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Nastav\u00ed sv\u011btla na 40 % v tepl\u00e9m t\u00f3nu.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd ve\u010der v 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Zapne klimatizaci na 20\u00b0 a nastav\u00ed termostat na 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Nastav\u00ed termostat na komfortn\u00ed nastaven\u00ed 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Ve v\u0161edn\u00ed dny 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Rozev\u0159e ka\u017ed\u00fd z\u00e1v\u011bs a roletu.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd den p\u0159i v\u00fdchodu slunce", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Zav\u00edr\u00e1 ka\u017edou z\u00e1clonu a roletu.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd den p\u0159i z\u00e1padu slunce", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Zamkne ka\u017ed\u00fd chytr\u00fd z\u00e1mek (z\u00e1mky se nikdy neodemknou).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Vyp\u00edn\u00e1 sv\u011btla a TV;ponech\u00e1v\u00e1 z\u00e1str\u010dky a AC na pokoji.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Zapn\u011bte nebo vypn\u011bte za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Ode\u0161le p\u0159\u00edkaz do jednoho za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e9 vyberete.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Kter\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Zapnout", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Vypn\u011bte", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Vyberte za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e9 chcete ovl\u00e1dat.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Pod\u00edvejte se, jakou kvalitu vzduchu, teplotu a vlhkost va\u0161e senzory m\u011b\u0159\u00ed a \u0159\u00edd\u00ed va\u0161i \u010disti\u010dku.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "P\u0159ipravte sv\u011btla, z\u00e1v\u011bsy a klimatizaci na den jedin\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Po p\u0159\u00edchodu dom\u016f zapn\u011bte sv\u011btla, z\u00e1v\u011bsy a klimatizaci spole\u010dn\u011b.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Uve\u010fte sv\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed do bezpe\u010dn\u00e9ho a energeticky \u00fasporn\u00e9ho stavu, kdy\u017e budete dlouho pry\u010d.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Ztlumte sv\u011btla, zat\u00e1hn\u011bte z\u00e1v\u011bsy a zapn\u011bte televizi.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Spus\u0165te robotick\u00fd vysava\u010d nebo jej po\u0161lete zp\u011bt do jeho doku.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Zamkn\u011bte dve\u0159e, zat\u00e1hn\u011bte z\u00e1v\u011bsy a p\u0159ipravte d\u016fm na noc.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Pod\u00edvejte se na stav a nastaven\u00ed soukrom\u00ed sv\u00fdch kamer na jedn\u00e9 obrazovce.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Zapn\u011bte nebo vypn\u011bte re\u017eim soukrom\u00ed pro sv\u00e9 kamery z jednoho m\u00edsta, kdy\u017e jste doma.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Pod\u00edvejte se, kter\u00e1 automatizace dnes b\u011b\u017e\u00ed.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Sd\u00edlejte pozn\u00e1mky a \u00fakoly se svou dom\u00e1cnost\u00ed.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Pod\u00edvejte se na souhrn zdravotn\u00edho stavu sv\u00e9ho domova ze vzduchu, vlhkosti a teploty, kter\u00e9 nam\u011b\u0159ily va\u0161e senzory.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
