    "Aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "K rodinn\u00e9mu chatu se mus\u00edte p\u0159ihl\u00e1sit.", // EN: You need to sign in for the family chat.
    "Cihaz eklenince haz\u0131r senaryolar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Po p\u0159id\u00e1n\u00ed za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed se zde objev\u00ed p\u0159ipraven\u00e9 sc\u00e9ny.", // EN: Ready-made scenes will appear here once you add a device.
